# aether-miso.package — the Miso agent (planner, UI integration, ledger client).
name: aether-miso
version_from: VERSION
recipe: packaging/PKGBUILD-aether-miso
license: GPL-3.0-only
source: miso
installs_to:
  /usr/libexec/aether/miso: miso/
unit: system/services/aether-agent.service (unprivileged, sandbox in security/sandbox/agent-sandbox.conf)
provides:
  - /run/aether/agent.sock (JSON-RPC: Agent.{ask,cancel,tasks,history})
boundary: |
  Miso NEVER executes model output as shell. All consequential operations are
  dispatched through the aether-capability-broker with typed schemas
  (miso/capability-os/schemas) and user-visible confirmation per policy.
depends: [python, python-yaml, aether-capability-broker]
